# Linkzly mobile SDK

Follow the [linkzly-mobile-sdk](../skills/linkzly-mobile-sdk/SKILL.md) skill for every step. It holds the order of work and a reference file for each section of the Linkzly docs, cut to your platform.

Three rules hold even if you read nothing else:

- Never make up an SDK key. Ask the person for it.
- `configure()` already sends the install and the opens. Do not add `trackInstall` or `trackOpen`.
- Every custom event name has to be registered for the app in the Linkzly console, or the event is dropped while the call succeeds.
